    <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.03">A strong website needs attention after launch.</h1>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:600px">Create Studio coordinates the setup, configuration, monitoring and routine maintenance that keep an approved website available and in good technical order — quietly, in the background, month after month.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#52525B;max-width:600px">Domain registration, hosting, SSL configuration, maintenance, renewals and other third-party services are quoted separately from the website project and from SEO plans.</p>
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:8px"><a href="/contact" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="5">Start a Project</a><a href="/seo-growth-maintenance" data-route="seo-growth-maintenance" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="6">Compare Plans</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;gap:70px;align-items:start">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">The problem</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">Maintenance is invisible until it isn’t.</h2></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">An expired certificate. Updates left for months. No recent backup. A contact form that has been failing silently since spring. None of it shows from the outside until someone tries to reach you.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Requirements also differ. A five-page informational site and an active platform with integrations do not need the same level of attention, which is why one fixed plan rarely suits everyone.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px;padding:48px;border-radius:28px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:660px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Our solution</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.12">Steady care, at the level the site warrants.</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">The technical base stays healthy — hosting, SSL, updates, backups, monitoring — minor content changes are handled as they come, and worthwhile improvements are flagged rather than quietly performed. Three plan levels exist so the cost matches the attention required.</p></div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px 32px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Hosting setup and administration when applicable</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>SSL configuration and renewal monitoring</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Backups</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Uptime monitoring</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Security checks</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Technical maintenance</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Performance monitoring</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Minor content changes</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Technical support</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Continued improvements</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Website health reporting</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Recovery support</span></div></div>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">Plans do not include unlimited changes or unlimited development. Larger requests are scoped and quoted separately so the monthly cost stays predictable.</div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">How the work runs</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em">One handover, then a steady monthly cycle.</h2></div><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:16px"><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">01</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Handover</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Access, hosting review and baseline checks.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">02</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Setup</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Backups, monitoring and update schedule.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">03</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Monitor</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Uptime, security and performance watched continuously.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">04</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Maintain</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Updates, minor changes and fixes.</p></div><div style="padding:24px;border-radius:18px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">05</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600">Report</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Website health summary and recommendations.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:40px;border-radius:26px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">What you get</div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;margin-top:4px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>A site that stays online and current</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Recent backups you can actually restore from</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Certificates and updates handled before they expire</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Minor changes made without a new project</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>One person accountable for the technical side</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Predictable monthly cost</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:34px;border-radius:26px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
   <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Plans begin at US$100/month</div>
   <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Essential Care — from US$100/month</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Growth — from US$200/month</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Growth Pro — from US$350/month</span></div></div>
   <p style="margin:0;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">Unsure which level applies? We will review the site’s size, platform, condition and objectives before recommending a plan.</p>
   <a href="/seo-growth-maintenance" data-route="seo-growth-maintenance" style="font-size:13px;color:#8B5CF6">Compare Plans →</a>
 </div></div>
</div></section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;"><div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px"><div data-ownership="" style="padding:30px 32px;border-radius:22px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.28);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
  <h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Client Ownership</h3>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Your domain and hosting account are registered under your name. You retain ownership and control of these digital assets, while Create Studio handles their approved setup and technical management.</p>
</div><div style="padding:30px 32px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
