  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
    <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Domain Registration — Quoted separately</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Third-party hosting service — Quoted separately</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>SSL certificate — availability and cost depend on the hosting provider; a paid certificate is quoted separately when required</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>SSL configuration and management — performed by Create Studio under the approved plan</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Technical administration — performed by Create Studio under the approved plan</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Website Maintenance — Quoted separately</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Email services, premium licenses and other third-party services — Quoted separately</span></div>
  </div>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#A1A1AA">Create Studio can manage the approved hosting configuration, HTTPS setup, updates, monitoring, and technical maintenance. Hosting services, premium certificates, licenses, and other third-party costs are quoted separately when applicable.</p>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.75;color:#52525B">SSL configuration and management requirements will be confirmed after the hosting environment is reviewed. Third-party providers set their own prices and renewal terms.</p>
</div></div>
 </section>
