    <a href="/services/web-design-development" data-route="service-web-design-development" style="padding:26px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;transition:border-color .3s ease,transform .3s ease" data-sh="15"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Web Design &amp; Development</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">The primary service. Landing pages, corporate sites, catalogs, portfolios and multilingual platforms — each one designed and built from scratch for the business behind it.</p><span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8B5CF6;margin-top:4px">Explore →</span></a><a href="/services/website-redesign" data-route="service-website-redesign" style="padding:26px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;transition:border-color .3s ease,transform .3s ease" data-sh="15"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">Website Redesign</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">Keep what works, rethink what doesn’t — structure, usability and visual presentation reviewed together.</p><span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8B5CF6;margin-top:4px">Explore →</span></a><a href="/services/crm-custom-systems" data-route="service-crm-custom-systems" style="padding:26px;border-radius:20px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;transition:border-color .3s ease,transform .3s ease" data-sh="15"><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600">CRM &amp; Custom Systems</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.6">When off-the-shelf software stops fitting, we design around the way your business actually works. Individually scoped, custom quoted.</p><span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#8B5CF6;margin-top:4px">Explore →</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
